  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-10-21T03:49:20.884Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be great to have a shared home world feature in VRChat for best friends or couples. This would allow players who are linked together to spawn in the same home world when they join the game.\n\nExample:\n\nPlayer A and Player B are best friends who decide to play VRChat together. Player B logs in first and loads into their shared home world. When Player A joins, they automatically spawn in the same world, right where Player B is waiting.",
